arbeitnow:senior-netsuite-administrator-:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior NetSuite Administrator &amp;amp; Developer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time&amp;nbsp; | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Salary: £58,000 to £70,000 DOE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8"&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;Riverlane is looking for an experienced NetSuite Administrator &amp;amp; Developer to define, develop and administer one of the business-critical systems that keeps the company running.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;This is a hands-on role combining day-to-day administration with development and continuous improvement. You'll keep our ERP platform stable, secure and well-configured, act as the senior escalation point for complex issues, and build the scripts, workflows and integrations that make NetSuite work harder for Finance, Operations and the wider business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our NetSuite Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are in the middle of a phased NetSuite implementation, and this role is central to owning and evolving the platform as it grows. You'll be joining as the environment is being stood up, giving you the opportunity to shape how it's run from the outset and ensure the environment has robust configuration, controls and data integrity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phase 1: NetSuite OneWorld across multiple entities and currencies. Scope includes fixed assets, multi-book accounting, currency revaluation, intercompany eliminations, and consolidation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phase 2: Expected to extend the platform with, Advanced Revenue Management for contract revenue recognition, and Inventory Management, including multi-location and serial-number tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administration &amp;amp; Configuration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the setup and configuration of NetSuite, including user roles, permissions, workflows and system preferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep configurations aligned with business processes and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform routine maintenance, manage updates, and troubleshoot issues to ensure system stability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the NetSuite subject matter expert, supporting the business, and provide training that helps end-users get the most from the platform in their daily work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data accuracy, integrity and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage segregation of duties within roles and permissions to support audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use sandbox environments and managing NetSuite's twice-yearly release updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development &amp;amp; Automation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and maintain custom scripts and workflows using SuiteScript, JavaScript and SuiteQL to automate tasks and improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process enhancements using native system capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure delivered solutions are fit for purpose, tested and documented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage automations and integrations to enhance the usefulness of the ERP solution and productivity of Riverlane staff.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Insights&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain dashboards and reports using native ERP reporting features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data transformation and visualisation to inform operational and strategic decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Compliance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and enforce security policies that protect sensitive business data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage access controls and audit trails in line with standards such as ISO 27001 and Cyber Essentials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Optimisation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integration efforts between NetSuite and other business platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Finance, Operations and other teams to translate business needs into system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the IT management team on change requests and projects, delivering on time with documented testing and support materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the wider IT team with general issues to build overall team capacity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise administering NetSuite — configuration, customisation, migrations, maintenance and troubleshooting — ideally with 3+ years in a comparable role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient scripting across SuiteScript, JavaScript and SuiteQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data transformation and reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with financial data (required), and exposure to ERP implementations or phased rollouts (desirable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NetSuite certifications (SuiteFoundation, Administrator, or SuiteCloud Developer) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound understanding of data security, access control and compliance frameworks (ISO, Cyber Essentials).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to work effectively with stakeholders at all levels, with the ability to translate finance requirements into NetSuite configuration and to work effectively across stakeholders (Finance, Operations) and technical teams (developers, integration partners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first attitude, strong project-management discipline, and the ability to juggle multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and able to work both independently and as part of a team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane &lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;28 days annual leave, plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="22" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking 'Apply'. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle="Hyperlink"&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id="OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6" class="x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink" href="https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="1"&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:ai-enabled-software-engineer-1:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}"&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work for any employer in the country in which the role is being hired. We are unable to sponsor or take over sponsorship of an employment visa at this time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Mark43’s mission is to empower communities and their governments with new technologies that improve the safety and quality of life for all. We build powerful, scalable, and elegant software that sets a new standard for the tools upon which our first responders rely. Our users are diverse, and we are therefore committed to embracing diversity of thought and experience within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Our platform is already trusted by major public safety agencies across North America—including Boston, D.C., Seattle, and the California Highway Patrol—and we’ve expanded into the UK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Now, we’re entering an exciting new chapter: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Mark43 is building a next-generation AI-augmented engineering team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;. This is a foundational opportunity to help rethink how software is designed, developed, and delivered using intelligent agentic or related tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2"&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We’re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; to help lead our AI-enabled engineering initiative. You’ll work at the frontier of AI and software development, experimenting with agentic workflows and shaping how AI tools are integrated into every layer of our engineering stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;This isn’t just about using AI to autocomplete code—it’s about &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;designing and orchestrating systems of AI agents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; that can plan, write, review, test, and deploy software collaboratively. In essence, you’ll play a role akin to a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;tech lead for a team of intelligent coding agents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;You will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Design multi-agent systems with coding-focused agents (e.g., code writer, reviewer, tester, deployer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="4" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Write the prompts, logic, and scaffolding that guide each agent’s behavior&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
